hadiths[19]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1930","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo duniya mein sharaab peey, phir us se tauba na karey to wo aakhirat mein us se mehroom hoga. (Bukhari: 5575)"
"1931","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zaani zina nahi karta jab wo zina karta hai jabke wo momin ho. Aur sharaab peenay wala sharaab nahi peeta jab wo use peeta hai jabke wo momin ho. Aur chor chori nahi karta jab wo chori karta hai jabke wo momin ho. (Bukhari: 5578)"
"1932","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein bhi hai: Aur lootney wala izzat wali loot nahi loot-ta jise log dekhtey hain jab wo use loot-ta hai jabke wo momin ho. (Bukhari: 5578)"
"1933","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bit key baarey mein poochha gaya. Jabke wo shehed ka nabeedh hai jise Yaman waley peetey they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har peena jo nashaa dey wo haraam hai. (Bukhari: 5586)"
"1934","[AI-translation] Abu Aamir Ashaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Meri ummat mein qaumein hongi jo sharmgaah aur resham aur sharaab aur baajon ko halaal karengi. Aur qaumein jhandey key pehlu mein utrengi. Un par unka charney wala subah aayega. Unkey paas haajat key liye aayega. To wo kahengey: Hamaarey paas kal wapas aao! To Allah unhey raat ko halaak karega aur jhanda rakheyga. Aur doosron ko Qiyaamat key din tak bandar aur khinzeer bana dega. (Bukhari: 5590)"
"1935","[AI-translation] Abu Usaid Saaedi se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski shaadi mein bulaaya. To uski biwi unki khaadima thi jabke wo dulhan thi. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum jaantey ho main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kya pilaaya? Main ne Aap key liye raat ko pyaaley mein khajoorein bhigoaein. (Bukhari: 5591)"
"1936","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashkeezon se mana kya to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha gaya: Har aadmi mashkeeza nahi paata. To Aap ne unhey ghair qalaai walay matkay mein rukhsat di. (Bukhari: 5993)"
"1937","[AI-translation] Abu Qataada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke khajoor aur kachchi khajoor ko jama kya jaey. Aur khajoor aur kishmish ko. Aur un mein se har aik ko alag alag nabeedh banaaya jaey. (Bukhari: 5602)"
"1938","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Humaid Naqee se doodh ka pyaala laaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Tum ne use kyun na dhaanpa? Agarchey tum us par lakdi rakho! (Bukhari: 5606)"
"1939","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Achha sadqa doodh wali oontni tohfey mein hai. Aur doodh wali bakri tohfey mein hai. Jo subah bartan key sath aati hai aur shaam doosrey key sath jaati hai. (Bukhari: 5608)"
"1940","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ansaar mein se aadmi key paas daakhil huey jabke Aap key sath Aapka saathi tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Agar tumhaarey paas paani ho jo is raat mashkeezay mein raha ho, warna ham chullu se piyengey. Unhon-ne kaha: Jabke aadmi apni deewar mein paani pher raha tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Merey paas raat ka paani hai. To chhappar ki taraf chalo! Unhon-ne kaha: To wo un donon ko ley gaya aur pyaaley mein undela, phir us par apne paaltu (bakri) ka doodh doha. Unhon-ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne piya. Phir wo aadmi piya jo Aap key sath aaya tha. (Bukhari: 5613)"
"1941","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Chauda ke darwaazay par aey aur khadey ho kar piya. To farmaya: Beshak log naapasand kartey hain ke un mein se koi khadey ho kar peey. Jabke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap ne waisa kya jaisa tum ne mujhey kartey huey dekha. (Bukhari: 5615)"
"1942","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zamzam se khadey ho kar piya. (Bukhari: 5617)"
"1943","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashkeezon ko morney se mana kya. Yaani unkey munhon se peena. (Bukhari: 5625)"
"1944","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashkeeza ya mashke key munh se peenay se mana kya. Aur ke wo apne padosi ko mana karey ke wo apni lakdi uskey ghar mein gaadey. (Bukhari: 5627)"
"1945","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) teen saans letey they. (Bukhari: 5631)"
"1946","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo chaandi key bartan mein peeta hai wo apne pet mein Jahannum ki aag gar garaata hai. (Bukhari: 5634)"
"1947","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Bani Saaeda key chhappar mein tashreef laaey. To Aap ne farmaya: Hamein pilaao ae Sahl! To main ne unhey pyaaley mein pilaaya. Raawi ne kaha: To Sahl ne hamaarey liye wo pyaala nikaala aur ham ne us mein se piya. Phir uskey baad Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne use maanga aur us ne use dey diya. (Bukhari: 5637)"
"1948","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke uskey paas Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka pyaala tha. To Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is pyaaley mein itna itna pilaaya hai. Jabke us mein lohey ka halqa tha. To Anas ne chaaha ke uski jagah sonay ya chaandi ka halqa banaaey. To Abu Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne us se kaha: Jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne banaaya hai use na badlo! To us ne use chhor diya. (Bukhari: 5638). Beemaaron ki kitaab."
